Floating Plasma Keyboard is a modified version of KDE Plasma Keyboard.

The source tree contains files under several license options. See each
file's SPDX-License-Identifier and the complete texts in LICENSES/.

The bundled keyboard click (src/sounds/keyboard_tick2_quiet.wav) is licensed
GPL-3.0-only, copyright 2013 Canonical Ltd. The default sound-enabled build includes
this GPLv3-only material. The complete GPLv3 text is in LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt.

All inherited copyright and license notices remain in place. New packaging files
carry their own SPDX notices. No license is granted to third-party trademarks.

The English and Swedish completion data in src/suggestions/ are adapted from
wordfreq 3.1.1 by Robyn Speer and contributors, under CC-BY-SA-4.0. See
src/suggestions/NOTICE.md and LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.
